                                                  T18
                                                  T19   0
      THE TEXT, AS A LIST OF WORD       1
      SYMBOLS, HEAD T39: ONCE UPON A    1
      MIDNIGHT DREARY WHILE I PONDERED  1
      WEAK AND WEARY OVER MANY A QUAINT 1
      AND CURIOUS VOLUME OF FORGOTTEN   1
      LORE                              1
